  "revisions": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "source": "There is plenty to attack Trump on, but it seems odd to hear a sitting President take such a negative line during one of their final moments in the spotlight.",
      "sha256": "369979774f084f9aca62c47973e9b4214de099c54252ffcfc21b10fdd0a1f03b",
      "zh": "特朗普有很多地方可以攻击，但一位现任总统在最后几次备受瞩目的时刻之一，采取如此负面的论调，听起来有点奇怪。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2053@20/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2053@23/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2053@25/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2053@23/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "source": "There's nothing wrong with singing the praises of Obama.",
      "sha256": "5a2eeca92c2b179e5d48cb04e37be05d6b2ff603968e1e24786aea37ce021ee3",
      "zh": "赞扬奥巴马，没有什么不妥。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2055@21/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2055@24/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2055@4/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Carson/answer_feedback_json/2055@8/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "source": "There's nothing wrong with this choice.",
      "sha256": "5f045773ff14faa596a71dde3be174472b789337531f824a089769dde04854fa",
      "zh": "这个选择没有什么问题。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2056@22/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2057@23/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2056@24/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2057@25/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2056@26/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2057@27/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2056@25/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2057@26/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "source": "This could be a reasonable compromise on trade... or a way to pass the buck to whoever the next President will be.",
      "sha256": "47506097cf6b2db4bf256062193789bd8bb085c9ed9b9fba9b689563ecb372a8",
      "zh": "这或许是贸易问题上合理的妥协，也可能是把责任推给下一任总统。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2059@24/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2059@27/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2059@28/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2059@28/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "source": "This is a little incrementalist, especially compared to your attacks on Bernie Sanders in the primaries.",
      "sha256": "5de384ff2ababdd097220fc923dbcad00c1c15873e9ff09afabf817c4d474b22",
      "zh": "这有点偏向渐进改革，尤其与你初选中攻击伯尼·桑德斯的言辞相比。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2060@25/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2060@5/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Christie/answer_feedback_json/2060@4/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "source": "This is a moderate position, but it leaves some supporters a little disappointed.",
      "sha256": "31b36912284da67a9a913294b8bd136f016d9ae5c9df9521899bf90bba3a0d08",
      "zh": "这是温和的立场，但让一些支持者有点失望。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2062@26/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2062@6/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "source": "This is a safe answer -- it won't hurt you or help you either way.",
      "sha256": "a35ad62771860328951f2fdad2291fe1dd7c284d4dff0f06500336a9bd9a64cc",
      "zh": "这个回答很稳妥，不论怎样，都不会给你带来损失或帮助。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2064@27/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2064@30/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2064@30/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "source": "This is a surprisingly conservative position, based on the current environment and even your own past statements.",
      "sha256": "e287ef11a99e072da227bd7cddb53529b0d9bd9731c29cc9a60e5134ca6a7b0d",
      "zh": "考虑到目前的环境，甚至你自己过去的表态，这个立场保守得令人意外。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2065@28/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2065@8/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "source": "This is an unusual move, but it makes voting for you an easier pill to swallow for progressives and moderates alike, who just want to stop Trump this year.",
      "sha256": "e66c91940f5fca2ea0403c4dfd3447298042440b17305e568776cbd5b3dfa48d",
      "zh": "这个举动不寻常，但对今年只想挡住特朗普的进步派和温和派来说，投票支持你都更容易接受了。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2067@29/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2067@32/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2067@31/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2067@30/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "source": "This is another position taken straight from the platform of Bernie Sanders. Interesting decision.",
      "sha256": "f75a4b12d59aeeecd83804adc2cd5f03da1b08a3ff58d17a0027b902d2ee6b4f",
      "zh": "这又是一个直接取自伯尼·桑德斯党纲的立场。这个决定挺有意思。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2068@30/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2068@32/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Carson/answer_feedback_json/2068@9/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "source": "This is certainly evocative of the Bill Clinton era.",
      "sha256": "664e60e94179e504c5f6487ffeec601bd31336ede5d4936f8b921a987f71c815",
      "zh": "这确实让人想起比尔·克林顿的时代。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2069@31/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2069@33/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "source": "This is just what you were saying in the Democratic primaries.",
      "sha256": "41b93395779640fa313b88c32e794f30c6a4d812ed78fdf70dba462fc5d215eb",
      "zh": "这正是你在民主党初选时的说法。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2075@35/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2075@34/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Carson/answer_feedback_json/2075@11/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "source": "This is not the right way to “pivot to the center” for the general election.",
      "sha256": "f8de23f108971ce628e70c4d9e4860eb3898344959916143dcdd4b949a9e7b99",
      "zh": "为了大选“向中间转向”，这样做可不对。",
      "keys": [
