    {
      "index": 13,
      "source": "This is right in line with your views to date.",
      "sha256": "978208d618b0126e29dc89cbcb35b68c5282ef370707f18ec314ddb8b3f8f568",
      "zh": "这与你迄今的观点完全一致。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2091@46/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2091@16/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Christie/answer_feedback_json/2091@10/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "source": "This is surprisingly strident rhetoric, given your past views. But it inspires a lot more outrage in foreign policy circles than among actual voters.",
      "sha256": "c0696e3ea020e874da2ccd936e690bb9dd2a092cd0fd76387dbffaa2fb5ef845",
      "zh": "考虑到你过去的观点，这番言辞强硬得令人意外。但外交政策圈的愤怒，远比实际选民强烈。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2092@47/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2092@38/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2092@36/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Christie/answer_feedback_json/2092@11/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Carson/answer_feedback_json/2092@17/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "source": "This seems like a non-sequitur to many, albeit one with a grain of truth.",
      "sha256": "bad1d42762aba44e3f825d9360fea75ea47daa97f8526cd22ba4380694cdf1bf",
      "zh": "许多人觉得，这像是在答非所问，尽管多少有点道理。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2094@48/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2094@39/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Carson/answer_feedback_json/2094@18/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "source": "This seems surprisingly passive, given the negative opinions about this episode.",
      "sha256": "8fe0f39ef18e2619d627bb81df5cf1a348c730f223e9b28a80388abc00410438",
      "zh": "考虑到大家对这件事的负面看法，这样似乎出奇地被动。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2096@49/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2096@43/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2096@42/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2096@39/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "source": "This statement evokes memories of the “triangulator”, Bill. But that might help you as much as it hurts you.",
      "sha256": "400360b45c1385d06680da17728f2235160d3479d68d7b9547ee159b72961a6d",
      "zh": "这个表态让人想起擅长“三角定位”的比尔。不过，它对你的帮助，可能和伤害一样大。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2097@50/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2097@40/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "source": "This statement isn't enough to appeal to moderates, and is disappointing to progressive supporters.",
      "sha256": "5d88fbcc717951a3b16a4647c5985629e79a69b0e13a44b5e1ce6cc635e9b096",
      "zh": "这个表态不足以吸引温和派，也让进步派支持者失望。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2098@51/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2098@41/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "source": "This strikes a moderate tone, but it may be out of step in 2016.",
      "sha256": "9087b5f588f6b0241874661564e92f2bcf504db99fd4dc53243f887699ca9ded",
      "zh": "这听起来很温和，但可能与2016年的形势脱节。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2099@52/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2099@44/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2099@43/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2099@42/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "source": "To many progressives, this seems overly passive in the face of the global warming threat.",
      "sha256": "7c5bb74af7cfebc12ddd3a972d16d2235ccf21df364aea0a7cb49b84c254e8fa",
      "zh": "许多进步派觉得，面对全球变暖威胁，这样显得过于被动。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2101@53/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2101@46/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2101@44/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2101@17/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Carson/answer_feedback_json/2101@19/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "source": "Trump is having serious problems with the female vote, and there's no reason you shouldn't twist the knife.",
      "sha256": "6103c9f2a1a88834149005958875edd46d3de29495c4f9657e5d6629dfcadf8b",
      "zh": "特朗普在女性选民中遇到了严重问题，你没理由不再补上一刀。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2104@54/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2104@47/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2104@44/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2104@45/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "source": "Trump isn't popular. But people were a little started to hear such a negative nomination speech, in what is one of your most important moments in the spotlight.",
      "sha256": "255dbf5b80a83beeecc7e4b9ece3a26189274c49aeced5d780968d54cc27cfa0",
      "zh": "特朗普不受欢迎。但在你最重要的聚光灯时刻之一，提名演说竟然如此负面，大家还是有点吃惊。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2105@55/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2105@48/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2105@45/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2105@46/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "source": "Trump University is a major liability for The Donald.",
      "sha256": "8243e087e6d616b8885a2b63d238b229b1d5e870a6f9c157459136090e33950e",
      "zh": "特朗普大学是“那位唐纳德”的一大包袱。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2106@56/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2106@49/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2106@46/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2106@47/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2107@48/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2108@49/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "source": "Unfortunately, for whatever reason, you just weren't on your game in these debates. Even liberal pundits are having a hard time explaining it.",
      "sha256": "4423e34d8f85f340f2cfc69b1fa118e4cac7c5bd9b6877eff723170987bfc0aa",
      "zh": "遗憾的是，不知为什么，你在这些辩论中就是不在状态。连自由派评论员都很难解释。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2111@57/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2111@50/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2111@49/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2111@52/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "source": "Word is getting around that you seem to have snubbed Bernie Sanders. This is probably not a good idea.",
      "sha256": "e8d285bc06ccbc11455385ddefeaf778c823d4efc214bc52a3f81009472d56a1",
      "zh": "大家渐渐传开了，说你似乎冷落了伯尼·桑德斯。这大概不是好主意。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2115@58/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2116@59/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2115@51/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2116@52/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2116@52/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2115@53/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "source": "You might have to hit Sanders's talking points a little more than you'd like, but his presence will definitely be helpful.",
      "sha256": "6032f257ce17ece249bd9c84567910e23ccc3aee3432ccdc96775275b4920365",
      "zh": "你也许得比自己愿意的更多地采用桑德斯的说辞，但他的参与肯定会有帮助。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2119@60/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2119@54/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2119@54/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "source": "You quickly clarify that you were not trying to attack the legacy of Obama, but nonetheless a few people are getting that impression.",
      "sha256": "1f0db831518eb93b365d9521a85302289b4ddcd5906d1f313a0f42a604b760be",
      "zh": "你迅速澄清，自己不是想攻击奥巴马的政治遗产。不过，仍有一些人得到那样的印象。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2120@61/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2120@55/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2120@18/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Carson/answer_feedback_json/2120@20/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "source": "You've strangely taken the side of the right in one of this election's defining issues.",
      "sha256": "a1f5b931270fc398788f7e9f866a1c7e58291966cc58196834ac4ad5d957bf2d",
      "zh": "在本次选举的标志性议题之一上，你竟然站到了右派一边。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2122@62/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Carson/answer_feedback_json/2122@21/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "source": "Your decision not to debate Trump is unpopular, and makes little sense to most people.",
      "sha256": "dd0d396788aac9f4f27a5ac5cc7b6df18b0ce4843ebf16580ff855eaad050cdc",
      "zh": "你不与特朗普辩论的决定不受欢迎，而且多数人觉得没什么道理。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2123@63/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2123@56/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2123@55/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2123@56/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "source": "Your party and supporters mostly want to hear more aggressive rhetoric on the gun control issue.",
      "sha256": "81414e26787f6eb35ab3dec0c0b56d21fff6ea538f294f2823e5c233cdfc0c80",
      "zh": "你的党和支持者多数希望，在枪支管制问题上听到更积极进取的言辞。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2124@64/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2124@19/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Christie/answer_feedback_json/2124@12/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "source": "Your speech fires up the convention hall and sets a good tone for the coming campaign.",
      "sha256": "6ac93d7edafa472d981db3734aee6f27826d648d86067b1c15c4652e3b0209ed",
      "zh": "你的演说点燃了大会会场，为接下来的竞选开了个好头。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2126@65/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2127@66/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2128@67/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2126@58/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2127@59/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2128@60/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2126@56/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2127@57/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2128@58/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2126@57/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2127@58/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2128@59/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "source": "This is too much of a 180 on the gun control issue for most people to process.",
      "sha256": "5980b579e4b0e3414c23d1a0f875448773e95c6f0bfdd1e2b3defb419b52419f",
      "zh": "你在枪支管制问题上来了个180度大转弯，多数人难以接受。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2179@68/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2179@54/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Christie/answer_feedback_json/2179@47/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "source": "It can't hurt you to be magnanimous once in awhile.",
      "sha256": "d33ced96c54f71fac54515fcf7479f6aef760d6020cff5536615ba56521ac1e6",
      "zh": "偶尔大度一点，对你没有坏处。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2187@69/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2187@63/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2187@55/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Carson/answer_feedback_json/2187@52/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "source": "Your unexpected praise of Obama is not helpful for your campaign.",
      "sha256": "9a4ea370b61eeb88494480079801e3dc6c88144cc5e207cf6aaa22d77d99727d",
      "zh": "你出人意料地赞扬奥巴马，对竞选没有帮助。",
      "keys": [
