        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2189@62/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2203@66/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2212@71/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answer_feedback_json/2201@63/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2203@65/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2197@57/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Brown/answer_feedback_json/2203@61/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Carson/answer_feedback_json/2193@54/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Trump_Carson/answer_feedback_json/2203@58/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "source": "People joke about what “serious danger” means, but you seem to be leaving the door open to some exceptions.",
      "sha256": "4248a5bda1371b7b11c3f33ebfcd49aa21063ea5419300cdf7fd8a397f70a47c",
      "zh": "人们拿“严重危险”的含义开玩笑，但你似乎为某些例外留了余地。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Booker/answer_feedback_json/2190@72/answer_feedback",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answer_feedback_json/2190@63/answer_feedback"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "source": "Conservatives distrusted you enough already. Now you've added fuel to the fire in a big way.",
      "sha256": "2afab82235f36fc3d9f2d70c6a9ceea3c52295ad981113eaae64d64d0394fc30",
      "zh": "保守派本来就够不信任你了。现在，你又狠狠地火上浇油。",
