    {
      "index": 46,
      "source": "What was your rationale behind selecting Julian Castro as your running mate?",
      "sha256": "926ef97fef93a5405419032b242a8bd56398f1c18e593edd0699e26ba7c2fdea",
      "zh": "你选择朱利安·卡斯特罗作为竞选搭档，理由是什么？",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/questions_json/805@1/description"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": true
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "source": "Donald Trump is regularly floating the accusation that Bill Clinton had a male child with an African-American hooker in Little Rock, and that both of you have conspired to bury the story. Do you have any comment?",
      "sha256": "829facc7c9135e6d15258a835780a93f6bedb3e4eef05c532ecf124d7de61329",
      "zh": "特朗普不断散布指控，称比尔·克林顿与小石城一名非裔妓女生下了一个男孩，而你们两人串通掩盖这件事。你有何评论？",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/questions_json/840@4/description",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/questions_json/840@6/description",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/questions_json/840@5/description"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "source": "There has been a coordinated, violent terrorist attack on Berlin today, resulting in the death of at least 100 people. How will you address this?",
      "sha256": "d6e5ae82abc4f93963326fedfdac01f8088190dab85725d691480a471583d7e5",
      "zh": "今天，柏林发生了一起协同实施的暴力恐怖袭击，造成至少100人死亡。你会如何回应？",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/questions_json/837@10/description",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/questions_json/837@14/description"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "source": "To what extent will you make an increase in the minimum wage a key part of your campaign? Do you stand by your commitment to $12/hour?",
      "sha256": "ea16bfa1f235459a0170cf8caeeb934c1199c28d4b0f545dcd58565a4c79fe64",
      "zh": "你会在多大程度上，把提高最低工资作为竞选的关键内容？你仍坚持每小时12美元的承诺吗？",
      "keys": [
        "2016_Clinton_Kaine/questions_json/1057@9/description",
        "2016_Clinton_Warren/questions_json/1057@10/description",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/questions_json/794@12/description",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/questions_json/794@16/description"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
