        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/questions_json/800@16/description",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/questions_json/800@11/description"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "source": "Do you stand by your position, voiced during the primaries, that you will not deport any illegal immigrant who has not otherwise committed a crime?",
      "sha256": "84db61fe7975958cf133378e4f97c185d2a3cc3b0b39875eefd6a1777d72a0ae",
      "zh": "初选期间，你表示不会遣返没有犯下其他罪行的非法移民；你仍坚持这一立场吗？",
      "keys": [
        "2016_Clinton_Sanders/questions_json/1064@11/description",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/questions_json/799@17/description",
