      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "source": "Do you support the practice of fracking? What is your overall view on energy policy?",
      "sha256": "329b9904f209b6136c4db3baa091cb0278539e82fc466fb5d08fde1559da5396",
      "zh": "你是否支持水力压裂？你对能源政策的总体看法是什么？",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/questions_json/828@19/description",
