      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "source": "Do you support the recent nuclear deal between the United States and Iran?",
      "sha256": "c4139efe7d79594e7338df5e45dc8b0d84e5a36e79aa2bafcb9261e020917abf",
      "zh": "你是否支持美国与伊朗最近达成的核协议？",
      "keys": [
        "2016_Clinton_Kaine/questions_json/1068@16/description",
        "2016_Clinton_Booker/questions_json/1068@9/description",
        "2016_Clinton_Sanders/questions_json/1068@15/description",
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/questions_json/817@20/description",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/questions_json/817@22/description",
        "2016a_Trump_Christie/questions_json/817@20/description"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "source": "What is your take on the Black Lives Matter movement?",
      "sha256": "4d75e63f4a38a8a1a7189cc924335d2a10e99311f470f14818c598913eef36d2",
      "zh": "你如何看待“黑人的命也是命”运动？",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/questions_json/831@22/description"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "source": "We should focus on defending the Affordable Care Act from the attacks being levied on it.",
      "sha256": "ca2634aad40e1b485468d6141d3e02afa5e90f25e5502f9a28811b24f1d8e936",
      "zh": "我们应该把重点放在捍卫《平价医疗法案》、抵御针对它的攻击上。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answers_json/4632@3/description",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answers_json/4632@3/description"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "source": "I'm going to announce during my acceptance speech that I support a minimum wage of $15 an hour.",
      "sha256": "b9abb452fb102d34e844838d4039f093bb842544c38922a13ed5ee6b5dabb1ad",
      "zh": "我会在接受提名的演说中宣布，我支持每小时15美元的最低工资。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answers_json/4613@25/description",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answers_json/4613@24/description"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "source": "Most Americans want to see an increase in the minimum wage, and I stand by my support for this measure.",
      "sha256": "aff7aa14d1b2cb6440d639134b625fc75bbc4f9b2fc9ca9b9ca0ef42c4dbcd00",
      "zh": "多数美国人希望提高最低工资，我仍坚持支持这项措施。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answers_json/4614@26/description",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answers_json/4614@25/description"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "source": "This is part of my platform, but it won't be a central part of my campaign speeches.",
      "sha256": "5af198978535d5d4e76c5c5433665aaf18262af080c785845d7a5a9da6a8297e",
      "zh": "这是我政纲的一部分，但不会成为竞选演说的核心内容。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answers_json/4615@27/description",
        "2016a_Clinton_Brown/answers_json/4615@26/description"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
      "changed": false
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "source": "I stand by that statement 100 percent. And I will push for immigration reform within my first 100 days as President.",
      "sha256": "a82be8d61f9bb9c22f56442a810876855c382fed43b4552c102cb84ae764151f",
      "zh": "我百分之百坚持这项表态。而且，我会在担任总统的头100天内推动移民改革。",
      "keys": [
        "2016a_Clinton_Castro/answers_json/4628@34/description",
        "2016a_Clinton_Warren/answers_json/4628@29/description"
      ],
      "method": "human-full-field",
